# ============================================================================
# The repo root IS the published site: GitHub Pages serves these files as-is,
# and .nojekyll means nothing is filtered. So anything committed here is
# reachable over the web, whether or not a page links to it.
#
# These are deliberately NOT part of the site, so they stay out of the repo.
# ============================================================================

# Working notes and build constraints for the QUBO/QAOA workbench. Guidance for
# whoever edits the tool next, not content for anyone visiting it.
CLAUDE.md

# The test harnesses. "Not shipped" is one of the tool's own constraints, and on
# a Pages repo the only way to honour that is to not commit them.
#   - JS suites (node validation/run_all.sh)
#   - templates_check.py, which executes generated PennyLane
#   - benchmarks/, including third-party DIMACS instance files
validation/

# The build brief for the quant-ph Radar. Instructions for whoever builds the
# tool, not content for anyone visiting it.
ARXIV_RADAR_BRIEF.md

